---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const CALENDLY_URL = "https://calendly.com/selfdevelopmentpathway/30min";
const AMAZON_URL = "#"; // Replace with actual Amazon link
---

<Layout
  title="The Book | Pathway Career Coaching"
  description="Erica Peryga's book on career transformation, purpose-driven work, and The Pathway Method."
>

  <!-- Book Hero -->
  <section class="min-h-screen flex items-center pt-20 relative overflow-hidden"
    style="background: linear-gradient(150deg, #1a1410 0%, #2c2420 40%, #1a1410 100%);">

    <!-- Gold ambient glow -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none">
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] h-[600px] opacity-15"
        style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse, #b87e27 0%, transparent 65%);">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-20 w-full">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">

        <!-- Book cover -->
        <div class="flex justify-center lg:justify-end order-2 lg:order-1">
          <div class="relative">

            <!-- Ambient glow -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 translate-x-4 translate-y-8 blur-3xl opacity-50 rounded-sm"
              style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b87e27, #d4a84b);">
            </div>

            <!-- Page-edge illusion -->
            <div class="absolute top-1 bottom-1 -right-[3px] w-[6px] bg-cream-200/50 rounded-r-sm"></div>
            <div class="absolute top-1 bottom-1 -right-[6px] w-[5px] bg-cream-100/30 rounded-r-sm"></div>

            <!-- Book wrapper -->
            <div class="relative group w-[280px] lg:w-[360px] shadow-[0_40px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] group-hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 cursor-pointer"
              style="aspect-ratio: 2/3;">

              <img
                src="/Pathway-Book-Cover.png"
                alt="Pathway Career Coaching — Erica Peryga"
                class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
              />

              <!-- Spine shadow -->
              <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-5 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/40 to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>
              <!-- Gloss sheen -->
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 via-transparent to-transparent z-20 pointer-events-none"></div>
              <!-- Bottom edge -->
              <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-8 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/25 to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Gold corner accents -->
            <div class="absolute -top-2 -right-2 w-8 h-8 border-t-2 border-r-2 border-gold-500/50 z-30"></div>
            <div class="absolute -bottom-2 -left-2 w-8 h-8 border-b-2 border-l-2 border-gold-500/50 z-30"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Book info -->
        <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <span class="w-8 h-px block" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, #d4a84b, #b87e27);"></span>
            <span class="font-body text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-gold-400">New Release</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="font-display text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-cream-100 leading-tight mb-6">
            The Pathway Method<br />
            <em class="text-gradient-gold text-4xl">The Proven System for Reinventing Your Career and What Comes Next</em>
          </h1>

          <p class="font-body text-cream-200/60 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-md">
            In her debut book, Erica Peryga takes you behind the methodology that has transformed hundreds of careers. Drawing from 15+ years of coaching and research, this is the guide she wishes she had—and the one her clients have been asking for.
          </p>

          <!-- Book highlights -->
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
            {[
              "The complete Pathway Method, step by step",
              "Mindset tools to overcome imposter syndrome",
              "Proven job search systems for the modern market",
              "Exercises to clarify your purpose and build your brand",
              "Tech industry–specific strategies and insights",
            ].map(point => (
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3 text-cream-200/70">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#b87e27" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
                </svg>
                <span class="font-body text-sm">{point}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <!-- Buy buttons -->
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
            <a href={AMAZON_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary">
              Buy on Amazon
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" x2="21" y1="14" y2="3"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a href={CALENDLY_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="btn-outline border-cream-200/20 text-cream-200 hover:bg-cream-100 hover:text-charcoal-900">
              Work With Erica
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About the Book -->
  <section class="py-28 bg-cream-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">

      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-500 block"></span>
          <span class="font-body text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-gold-500">About the Book</span>
          <span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-500 block"></span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-charcoal-900 mb-6">
          More Than a Career Guide.<br />
          <em class="text-gradient-gold">A Life Guide.</em>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
          <div class="space-y-5 font-body text-charcoal-800/70 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              What if the biggest thing standing between you and your dream career isn't your resume—it's your beliefs about what you deserve?
            </p>
            <p>
              In this groundbreaking book, Erica Peryga reveals that true career transformation starts from the inside out. Through the lens of The Pathway Method, she guides you through a proven process of self-discovery, strategic planning, and courageous action.
            </p>
            <p>
              Whether you're just starting out, pivoting industries, or ready for your next level of leadership, this book gives you the exact tools, frameworks, and mindset shifts you need to build a career that doesn't just pay the bills—it fuels your soul.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-5 font-body text-charcoal-800/70 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Erica draws on over 15 years of coaching hundreds of professionals—from recent graduates to C-suite executives—and shares the patterns, breakthroughs, and hard-won wisdom from thousands of coaching hours.
            </p>
            <p>
              This isn't a book of platitudes. It's a practical, personal, and powerful guide backed by real data, real stories, and Erica's signature blend of strategy and heart.
            </p>
            <p class="font-display italic text-xl text-charcoal-900">
              "Your career should be your pathway to purpose—and this book will show you exactly how to walk it."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Book CTA -->
  <section class="py-20 text-center"
    style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f2e0de 0%, #e8cbc8 100%);">
    <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl text-charcoal-900 mb-4">
        Ready to Walk Your Pathway?
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body text-charcoal-800/60 mb-8">
        Get the book—or take the next step with 1:1 coaching from Erica herself.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href={AMAZON_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary">
          Buy the Book
        </a>
        <a href={CALENDLY_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-outline">
          Book a Free Coaching Call
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
